<script setup lang="ts">import {fmt} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{trace:any;states:string[]}>();</script><template><section class="posterior-grid"><div class="section-head"><h2>每个时刻，状态仍有分布。</h2><span>前向×后向 / 序列likelihood归一</span></div><div class="posterior-scroll"><div class="posterior-table" :style="{minWidth:Math.max(500,trace.tokens.length*24+125)+'px'}"><div class="posterior-row" v-for="(state,s) in states" :key="state"><strong>{{s}} / {{state}}</strong><span v-for="(row,t) in trace.posterior" :key="t" class="posterior-cell" :style="{backgroundColor:'oklch(78% .08 88 / '+row[s]+')'}" :title="'t'+(Number(t)+1)+': '+fmt(row[s],8)"><small v-if="trace.tokens.length<=12" :style="{color:row[s]>.6?'var(--ink)':'var(--paper)'}">{{fmt(row[s],3)}}</small></span></div></div></div><p>颜色来自真实边际后验；每列和为1。状态标签由固定模型定义，不能直接等同设备故障。</p></section></template>
